OL,3,GNEWSAFlap over geese moved from village
OL,4,Aby council                             
OL,6,FResidents in a village where geese     
OL,7,F"disappeared mysteriously" have said   
OL,8,Fthey want them to return.              
OL,10,FTwo geese have been residents in the   
OL,11,Fvillage of Lode, Cambridgeshire, for   
OL,12,Fseveral years, with a brood of goslings
OL,13,Fborn this summer. Many villagers had   
OL,14,Fbecome fond of them.                   
OL,16,FBut Lode Parish Council requested the  
OL,17,Fanimals be moved to a farm 18 miles    
OL,18,F(29km) in Elsworth.                    
OL,20,FA spokesperson for the parish council  
OL,21,Fsaid: "The geese have now been rehomed 
OL,22,Fand are safe and being well cared for."
